        rdfs:comment "Figure panel (f) maps paper concepts to demo components; equations are not cited by section. Evidence: 2013-chindapol-coral-flow.py L252–L273: 'From the paper to this demo' panel <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/f3fe478/2013-chindapol-coral-flow.py#L252-L273>." ;
